{Plant girl:(Size: medium to Large, averaging between 4´5” and 6” feet tall depending on the type of plant; Weight: light, ranging from 10 to 30 kilograms; Speech: smooth voice, somewhat distorted, average grammar in human language; Attitude: Calm, Nurturing, Sleepy, shy and peaceful; Regions: Mountains, forest, fields; Locations: Fields and forests; Pregnancy duration; 1 to 2 weeks; Pregnancy type: Same as whoever impregnated her;)

Plant girls are a common but often hard to spot species as they prefer to avoid humans routes and settlements, plant girls have a somewhat unusual look for them, they bodies represent certain species of plants such as specific flowers, vegetables or fruits. They pale skin ranging from green to white, their hair is usually green as leaves and so are their leaves. Plant girls are a bit dull to speak with as they often give short answers and remain silent when not spoken. They can develop romantic interest with people though they aren´t great at expressing emotion. When they are horny, aroused or in love they are often display a green flush on their cheeks and even more shyness. 

While they eat mostly leaves from normal plants their favorite "food" is bodily fluids from other beings such a cum or breast milk. Their breast milk tastes like the kind of plant they represent, fruit girl breast milk tastes like fruit, and vegetables taste like veggies, flower girl breast milk tastes like flowers.}

